  "description": "Compile-time AutoMapper CreateMap validation for .NET — a Roslyn analyzer that catches property type mismatches, nullable mapping issues, unmapped required properties, collection incompatibilities, nested maps, and missing CreateMap registrations before AutoMapperMappingException at runtime. Analyzes Profile, ForMember, MapFrom, ReverseMap, ConvertUsing, and ProjectTo configurations with intelligent code fixes. Twenty-three rules cover type safety, data integrity, complex mappings, performance, and configuration. Stays quiet when a mapping shape cannot be proven statically. Compatible with .NET Framework 4.8+, .NET 6.0+, 8.0+, 9.0+, and 10.0+.",
