  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.100 - AM032 preserves structured conditional directives when inserting null guards\n- A block-bodied converter whose first statement begins in a #if region no longer receives a duplicated directive\n- The new guard inherits indentation only; comments and structured directives remain attached to the original statement exactly once\n- The fixed document remains structurally balanced and compilable\n- No rule ID or severity changes",
